        "cited_text": "Sediment disaster and the warning signs \r\nUpper end\r\nHeight \r\nArea where damage to \r\nbuildings is anticipated \r\ncausing serious injuries \r\nor fatalies among \r\nresidents in the event \r\nof the conceentrated \r\nsteep slope failures."
