      "source": {
        "file": "yoshida/kozui_hm_en.pdf",
        "page": 8,
        "method": "citation",
        "cited_text": "In case that the flooding due to levee breaking, flooding due to rainfall of a size exceeding the rainfall that is the \r\npremise of the simulation and flooding due to a storm surge (high tide) and inland water etc., were not taken into \r\nconsideration."
